# 基础词 Unit08
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇-基础词
# 描述: 基础词Unit08核心词汇

{{brief}}{/briːf/}{{adj. 简短的；n. 摘要；v. 简要介绍}}{{He gave a brief overview of the project.}}
{{bright}}{/braɪt/}{{adj. 明亮的；聪明的}}{{The bright sunshine made everyone feel happy.}}
{{brilliant}}{/ˈbrɪliənt/}{{adj. 辉煌的；杰出的}}{{She is a brilliant scientist with many achievements.}}
{{bring}}{/brɪŋ/}{{v. 带来；引起}}{{Please bring your textbook to class tomorrow.}}
{{broad}}{/brɔːd/}{{adj. 宽阔的；广泛的}}{{The river is very broad at this point.}}
{{broadcast}}{/ˈbrɔːdkɑːst/}{{v./n. 广播；播放}}{{The game was broadcast live on television.}}
{{brother}}{/ˈbrʌðər/}{{n. 兄弟}}{{My brother is two years older than me.}}
{{brush}}{/brʌʃ/{{n. 刷子；画笔；v. 刷}}{{She used a brush to paint the wall.}}
{{budget}}{/ˈbʌdʒɪt/}{{n. 预算；v. 编预算}}{{We need to stick to our budget this month.}}
{{build}}{/bɪld/}{{v. 建造；建立}}{{They plan to build a new hospital in the area.}}
{{building}}{/ˈbɪldɪŋ/}{{n. 建筑物；大楼}}{{The tallest building in the city has 80 floors.}}
{{bulk}}{/bʌlk/}{{n. 大量；体积；主体}}{{We bought supplies in bulk to save money.}}
{{bullet}}{/ˈbʊlɪt/}{{n. 子弹}}{{The bullet missed the target by a few inches.}}
{{bunch}}{/bʌntʃ/}}{{n. 一束；一群；一串}}{{He bought a bunch of flowers for his wife.}}
{{burden}}{/ˈbɜːrdn/}{{n. 负担；重担；v. 使负担}}{{The tax burden on small businesses is increasing.}}
{{burn}}{/bɜːrn/}{{v. 燃烧；烧伤}}{{The fire burned for several hours before it was controlled.}}
{{burst}}{/bɜːrst/}{{v. 爆裂；突然发生；n. 爆发}}{{The balloon burst with a loud bang.}}
{{bury}}{/ˈberi/}{{v. 埋葬；埋藏}}{{The dog buried its bone in the backyard.}}
{{bus}}{/bʌs/}{{n. 公共汽车}}{{She takes the bus to work every morning.}}
{{bush}}{/bʊʃ/}{{n. 灌木；灌木丛}}{{The rabbit hid in the bush from the fox.}}
{{business}}{/ˈbɪznəs/}}{{n. 生意；商业；事务}}{{He started his own business at the age of 25.}}
{{busy}}{/ˈbɪzi/}{{adj. 忙碌的；热闹的}}{{I have been very busy with work this week.}}
{{but}}{/bʌt/}{{conj. 但是；prep. 除了}}{{I wanted to go, but I was too tired.}}
{{butter}}{/ˈbʌtər/}{{n. 黄油；v. 涂黄油}}{{She spread butter on the warm toast.}}
{{button}}{/ˈbʌtn/}{{n. 按钮；纽扣}}{{Press the red button to start the machine.}}
{{buy}}{/baɪ/}{{v. 购买}}{{I need to buy some groceries for the week.}}
{{cabinet}}{/ˈkæbɪnət/}{{n. 橱柜；内阁}}{{The prime minister reshuffled the cabinet last month.}}
{{cable}}{/ˈkeɪbl/}{{n. 电缆；有线电视}}{{The cable TV subscription includes over 100 channels.}}
{{calculate}}{/ˈkælkjəleɪt/}{{v. 计算；估计}}{{Can you calculate the total cost of the project?}}
{{call}}{/kɔːl/}{{v. 叫；打电话；n. 电话；呼叫}}{{I will call you when I arrive at the station.}}
{{calm}}{/kɑːm/}{{adj. 平静的；冷静的；v. 使平静}}{{She remained calm during the emergency.}}
{{camera}}{/ˈkæmərə/}{{n. 照相机；摄像机}}{{He bought a new camera for his photography hobby.}}
{{camp}}{/kæmp/}}{{n. 营地；v. 露营}}{{The children went to summer camp in the mountains.}}
{{campaign}}{/kæmˈpeɪn/}{{n. 运动；战役；v. 参加运动}}{{The advertising campaign was a huge success.}}
{{campus}}{/ˈkæmpəs/}{{n. 校园}}{{The university campus is beautiful in autumn.}}
{{cancel}}{/ˈkænsl/}{{v. 取消；撤销}}{{The flight was cancelled due to bad weather.}}
{{cancer}}{/ˈkænsər/}{{n. 癌症}}{{Early detection of cancer can save lives.}}
{{candidate}}{/ˈkændɪdət/}{{n. 候选人；考生}}{{There are five candidates for the position.}}
{{capable}}{/ˈkeɪpəbl/}{{adj. 有能力的；能干的}}{{She is capable of handling any challenge.}}
{{capacity}}{/kəˈpæsəti/}{{n. 容量；能力；身份}}{{The stadium has a capacity of 50,000 people.}}
